<h2 id=3D"CompassXandSecureZoneIntegration-Internal(i.e.employee)user">Inte=
rnal (i.e. employee) user</h2>
<ul>
 <li><span>BoR:&nbsp;</span><strong>IIQ</strong><span> (</span><span style=
=3D"text-decoration: underline;">key</span><span>: </span><span>Short ID</s=
pan><span> -(mapped to)-&gt; Okta's </span><span>IDP Subject</span><span>)<=
/span></li>
 <li><span><strong>Technical debt</strong></span>
  <ul>
   <li><u>Identity profile</u> is created &amp; maintained in CX/F&amp;UM (=
instead of IIQ)</li>
   <li><u>Okta profile</u> is created in the <u>external tenant</u> (instea=
d of the <u>internal&nbsp;tenant</u>)</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"CompassXandSecureZoneIntegration-Externaluser">External user</h2>
<ul>
 <li><span>BoR:&nbsp;</span><strong>CX/F&amp;UM</strong><span> (</span><spa=
n style=3D"text-decoration: underline;">key</span><span>: Okta's </span><sp=
an>IDP Subject</span><span>)</span></li>
 <li><span><u>Identity profile</u> is created &amp; maintained in CX/F&amp;=
UM (or in the 3rd party IdP for SSO users; then a local copy is maintained =
in CX/F&amp;UM)</span></li>
 <li><span><u>Okta profile</u> is created in the <u>external tenant</u></sp=
an></li>
</ul>
