      <p>POST /users</p>
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bottom-wid=
th: 1px;">
        <b>Request Body</b>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: xml; gutter: true">{
=09"active": &lt;boolean&gt;,
=09"userName": "&lt;bngfReferenceId&gt;",
=09"familyName": "",
=09"givenName": "",
=09"userType": "NBIN",
=09"preferredLanguage": "",
=09"groups": ["&lt;SZ App Group&gt;"]
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><em>=
/users</em> refers to Secure Zone profiles</span></span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><em>=
&nbsp;</em></span></span></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>TS.002</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Update SZ profile<sup>1,3</sup></p>
     <p>(incl. Disable)</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">CX</span></td=
>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=
=3D"color:#172b4d;">UAMA<sup>1,3</sup></span></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>PUT<span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"> =
/users/{szid}</span></span></p>
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bottom-wid=
th: 1px;">
        <b>Request Body</b>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: xml; gutter: true">{
=09"active": &lt;boolean&gt;,
=09"userName": "&lt;bngfReferenceId&gt;",
=09"familyName": "",
=09"givenName": "",
=09"userType": "NBIN",
=09"preferredLanguage": "",
=09"groups": ["&lt;SZ App Group&gt;"]
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Disa=
bling a profile will be allowed (i.e. <em>active =3D false</em>), but delet=
ing won't be possible.</span></span></p>
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><str=
ong>N.B. </strong><em>userName</em> is <u>not</u> modifiable from here. To =
do so, use the PATCH&nbsp;<em>/users/{szid} </em>endpoint.</span></span></p=
>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><em>=
&nbsp;</em></span></span></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>TS.003</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Assign/reassign SZ profile to a user</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">CX</span></td=
>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">UAMA<sup>1,3<=
/sup></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>PATCH /users/{szid}</p>
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bottom-wid=
th: 1px;">
        <b>Request Body</b>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: xml; gutter: true">{
=09"userName": "&lt;bngfReferenceId&gt;"
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><str=
ong>N.B.</strong> This endpoint doesn't exist yet. It remains to be created=
 by UAMA dev team. But a<span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">s agreed with <a cla=
ss=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-username=3D"elmm001" href=3D"/=
display/~elmm001" data-linked-resource-id=3D"108957276" data-linked-resourc=
e-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=3D"htt=
ps://wiki.bnc.ca">Mahdi El Masaoudi</a> , there won't be any limitation to =
reassign a SZ profile to another username. The only constraint would be to =
provide a valid username. Indeed, unassigning a SZ profile without providin=
g another username (e.g. <em>&lt;null&gt;</em> value or empty string) will =
be prohibited.</span></span></span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><em>&nbsp;</em></span></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>TS.004</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Fetch (int) identity profile</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">CX</span></td=
>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=
=3D"color:#172b4d;">Microsoft Graph API<sup>5</sup></span></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">GET /users/{userid}</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">&nbsp;</span>=
</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">&nbsp;</span>=
</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>TS.005</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Fetch SZ ID</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Okta</span></=
td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=
=3D"color:#172b4d;">ICR<sup>4</sup></span></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><spa=
n class=3D"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z =
ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak">POST /access-profiles/identifiers</span></span>=
</span></p>
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bottom-wid=
th: 1px;">
        <b>Request Body</b>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: xml; gutter: true">bngfReferenceId</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><br></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><em>&nbsp;</em></span></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">TS.006</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">Add user to Okta group</span></p></t=
d>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">CX</span></td=
>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">Okta profile-=
management API<sup>6</sup></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">PUT /groups/{=
groupName}/users/{userId}</span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Ref. TS.008</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">TS.007</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">Remove user from Okta group</span></=
p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">CX</span></td=
>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">Okta profile-=
management API<sup>6</sup></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#09326c;">DELETE /group=
s/{groupName}/users/{userId}</span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Ref. TS.008</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">TS.008</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">Get Okta group</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">CX</span></td=
>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><s><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">EBX API</span></s></p>
     <p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">UAMA</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">TBD</span></t=
d>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><u><strong><s>EBX</s> reference tab=
le schema</strong></u></span></p>
      <p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">SZ App, SZ App Group (aka Function =
Group), External Okta Group, Internal Okta Group</span></p>
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Ref. <a class=3D"confluence-userlin=
k user-mention" data-username=3D"elmm001" href=3D"/display/~elmm001" data-l=
inked-resource-id=3D"108957276" data-linked-resource-version=3D"2" data-lin=
ked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca">Mahdi =
El Masaoudi</a>&nbsp;</span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><strong><span style=3D"color:#172b4=
d;">N.B.</span></strong><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"> </span><span style=
=3D"color:#172b4d;"><time datetime=3D"2025-07-25" class=3D"date-past">25 Ju=
l 2025</time> For performance concerns, SZ team decided to skip EBX and hos=
t the mapping directly in SZ, accessible through UAMA. New endpoint(s) will=
 be made available.</span></span></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>TS.009</p>
      <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-error">TO REVI=
EW</span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Get employee profile changes</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">CX</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Microsoft Gra=
ph API<sup>5</sup></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">GET /users/{userid}</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>Upon GET /users/{userconfigurationid} API call, query Graph API to=
 keep local record up-to-date. (Option 3 below)</p>
      <p>Ref. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.wealth-ta.api=
s.bnc.ca/user-conf/swagger-ui/index.html" rel=3D"nofollow">https://nbin.wea=
lth-ta.apis.bnc.ca/user-conf/swagger-ui/index.html</a></p>
      <p>Options:</p>
      <ol>
       <li>A single webhook for all NBC employees. Filter locally on CX reg=
istered employees=20
        <ul>
         <li><strong>Simple</strong> but <strong>somewhat inefficient</stro=
ng> as there are about 20,000 employees where less than 1% are CX registere=
d. Hopefully, profile updates might not be as frequent.</li>
        </ul></li>
       <li>A webhook per CX registered employee=20
        <ul>
         <li><strong>Efficient</strong> but <strong>higher maintenance</str=
ong> as a webhook must be setup for each employee of interest.</li>
        </ul></li>
       <li>Pull request (i.e. HTTP GET /users/{userid}) for each CX registe=
red employee=20
        <ul>
         <li><strong>Somewhat efficient</strong> and&nbsp;<strong>low maint=
enance</strong> but <strong>eventually consistent</strong></li>
        </ul></li>
      </ol>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>TS.010</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Get SZ profiles assigned to a user</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">CX</span></td=
>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">UAMA</span></=
td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">GET /users?filter=3Dusername sw &lt;bngfRefe=
renceId&gt;</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><em>=
/users?filter </em>refers to Secure Zone profiles f</span></span><span styl=
e=3D"color:#172b4d;">iltered by some criteria</span></p>
      <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><strong>Ref.</strong> <a href=3D"/s=
paces/GPTI/pages/1477655234/SA8237+-+Conception+-+Business+rules">SA8237 - =
Conception - Business rules</a> &gt; BR_UAMA-012</span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
